  2332	 * `up` receives a save already at version `to - 1` and returns it at version
  2333	 * `to`. It must not assume anything the previous version did not guarantee, and
  2334	 * it must not set `schemaVersion` — the ladder stamps that, so a step can never
  2335	 * disagree with its own position.
  2336	 */
