   411	
   412	### 4.3 English is baked into save files
   413	
   414	**Eleven** persisted surfaces carry English prose through the zod codec into
   415	SQLite. Early drafts of this spec claimed four, then seven; the council found
   416	the rest. The number is stated precisely because an implementer who works from a
   417	short list ships a game that still renders English from whatever the list
   418	missed.
   419	
   420	| # | Surface | Codec | Schema | Notes |
   421	| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
   422	| 1 | Ledger line `label` | `:190` | `.passthrough()` | Built in `game/career.ts:836-1004` |
   423	| 2 | Cash transaction `label` | `:185` | `.passthrough()` | Also fed from `game/player-requests.ts:422` via `definition.title` |
   424	| 3 | Season recap award `label`, `detail` | `:1132` | `.passthrough()` | |
